       or content.reviewed is distinct from excluded.reviewed
  returning node_id
)
delete from content
where node_id in (select node_id from master)
  and not (depth = 'research' and level = 'advanced' and format = 'read');

with q as (
  select $astroNW_quiz$[{"id": "q1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "How does Newton's First Law reframe the ancient question about planetary motion?", "options": ["It proves the planets are pushed by angels along their circles", "Since uniform straight-line motion needs no cause, and a curved orbit is a continuous CHANGE of direction, the orbit itself proves a FORCE is acting. The old question 'what keeps the planets moving?' becomes 'what BENDS their straight-line motion into orbits?' \u2014 inverting the ancient view that circular motion was the natural, causeless state of the heavens", "It shows that the planets are actually at rest and only appear to move", "It proves that heavier planets orbit faster than lighter ones"], "answerIndex": 1, "explanation": "Newton's First Law says a body keeps moving in a straight line at constant speed unless a force acts. A planet's orbit is curved \u2014 a continuous change of direction \u2014 so a force must be continuously bending it away from the straight path it would otherwise follow. To the ancients, eternal circular motion was natural and needed no explanation; to Newton, straight-line motion is natural, and it is the orbit that demands a cause. Nothing needs to keep the planets moving (inertia does that); what needs explaining is what bends their paths \u2014 and the answer is gravity."}, {"id": "q2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "State the law of universal gravitation, and identify its most important single word.", "options": ["Objects fall at 9.8 m/s\u00b2; the key word is 'fall'", "Every mass attracts every other with force F = Gm\u2081m\u2082/r\u00b2 \u2014 proportional to the masses, weakening as the inverse SQUARE of distance. The key word is UNIVERSAL: the same force acts on ALL matter everywhere, heavens and Earth alike \u2014 which is what dissolves the ancient division into separate terrestrial and celestial physics", "Planets attract the Sun but not each other; the key word is 'planets'", "Gravity acts only between large bodies; the key word is 'large'"], "answerIndex": 1, "explanation": "F = Gm\u2081m\u2082/r\u00b2: every mass attracts every other, proportional to the product of the masses and inversely proportional to the square of the distance. The crucial word is UNIVERSAL \u2014 gravity is a property of all mass whatsoever, acting the same way everywhere: on apples, moons, planets, stars, atoms. There is no separate celestial physics; one gravity governs the falling apple and the orbiting planet identically. That single word demolishes the two-thousand-year Aristotelian wall between the corruptible Earth and the perfect heavens."}, {"id": "q3", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "What did Newton's apple-and-Moon calculation show, and why was it so decisive?", "options": ["That the Moon is 60 times heavier than an apple", "Surface gravity (9.8 m/s\u00b2), weakened by the inverse square of the Moon's ~60-Earth-radii distance, predicts ~2.7 \u00d7 10\u207b\u00b3 m/s\u00b2 \u2014 and the Moon's ACTUAL orbital acceleration, computed independently from its orbital size and period (4\u03c0\u00b2r/T\u00b2), is ALSO ~2.7 \u00d7 10\u207b\u00b3 m/s\u00b2. The match proves the apple's gravity and the Moon's orbit are ONE force: the Moon is falling around the Earth", "That the Moon has no gravity of its own", "That the apple and Moon fall at the same speed"], "answerIndex": 1, "explanation": "The Moon is about 60 Earth-radii away, so by the inverse-square law gravity there should be 60\u00b2 \u2248 3,600 times weaker than at the surface: 9.8/3600 \u2248 2.7 \u00d7 10\u207b\u00b3 m/s\u00b2. Independently, the Moon's actual centripetal acceleration from its orbit (a = 4\u03c0\u00b2r/T\u00b2, with r = 384,400 km and T = 27.3 days) is also \u2248 2.7 \u00d7 10\u207b\u00b3 m/s\u00b2. Two utterly independent numbers agree to ~1%. This proves the force pulling the apple down IS the force holding the Moon in orbit \u2014 the Moon is perpetually falling, just moving sideways fast enough to keep missing the Earth. Heaven and Earth, unified in one checkable calculation."}, {"id": "q4", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "What did Newton show about each of Kepler's three laws?", "options": ["That all three were wrong and needed correction", "All three FOLLOW from gravity: ellipses with the Sun at a focus are the necessary shape of inverse-square orbits (explaining even the empty second focus); equal areas follow from gravity being a CENTRAL force (conserving angular momentum); and T\u00b2 \u221d a\u00b3 follows SPECIFICALLY from the inverse-square form \u2014 the harmonic law was gravity's fingerprint all along", "That they only hold for the six planets known to Kepler", "That they are approximations valid only for circular orbits"], "answerIndex": 1, "explanation": "Newton derived all three of Kepler's laws from universal gravitation. The First: an inverse-square force produces conic-section paths \u2014 ellipses for bound orbits, with the attracting body at one focus (the puzzling empty focus is just geometry; nothing needs to sit there). The Second: any central force (pointing straight at the Sun) conserves angular momentum, which is mathematically equivalent to equal areas in equal times. The Third: T\u00b2 \u221d a\u00b3 follows specifically from the inverse-square exponent \u2014 a different force law would give a different relation. Kepler's three separate, unexplained empirical patterns became three consequences of one cause."}, {"id": "q5", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why was the discovery of Neptune such a powerful confirmation of Newton's gravity?", "options": ["Because Neptune is the largest planet in the solar system", "Because the theory PREDICTED A NEW PLANET before anyone had seen it: tiny irregularities in Uranus's orbit led Le Verrier and Adams to calculate where an unseen planet must be to cause them \u2014 and Neptune was found in 1846 within a degree of the predicted spot. Predicting new facts, not just fitting known ones, is the strongest confirmation a theory can receive", "Because Neptune's orbit is a perfect circle, as Newton required", "Because it proved the Sun is the center of the universe"], "answerIndex": 1, "explanation": "Uranus was not quite where Newton's gravity said it should be. Rather than doubt the theory, Le Verrier (and Adams) trusted it and computed the position of an unseen eighth planet whose pull would explain the discrepancy. Telescopes pointed at the predicted spot found Neptune, within about a degree, in 1846. The theory had revealed an entire world by its invisible gravitational tug alone \u2014 not merely fitting known data but predicting a wholly new object. That is the strongest kind of confirmation a physical theory can receive, and it capped two centuries of Newtonian triumph."}, {"id": "q6", "type": "open", "prompt": "Walk through the apple-and-Moon calculation and Newton's cannonball, and explain what, together, they establish: what an orbit really is, why astronauts float, and why this one calculation dissolved the ancient division between heaven and Earth.", "rubric": "THE CALCULATION: (1) Gravity at the Earth's surface accelerates falling objects at g = 9.8 m/s\u00b2 (the apple). (2) The Moon lies about 60 EARTH-RADII away (384,400 km / 6,371 km \u2248 60.3). (3) If gravity weakens as the INVERSE SQUARE of distance, at the Moon it should be 60.3\u00b2 \u2248 3,600 times weaker: a_predicted = 9.8/3636 \u2248 2.7 \u00d7 10\u207b\u00b3 m/s\u00b2. (4) INDEPENDENTLY, the Moon's actual orbital (centripetal) acceleration follows from pure geometry \u2014 a = 4\u03c0\u00b2r/T\u00b2 with r = 3.844 \u00d7 10\u2078 m and T = 27.3 days \u2248 2.36 \u00d7 10\u2076 s \u2014 giving ALSO \u2248 2.7 \u00d7 10\u207b\u00b3 m/s\u00b2. (5) THE MATCH (to ~1%): two utterly independent numbers \u2014 surface gravity diluted by the inverse square, and the Moon's real acceleration from its motion alone \u2014 are the same. This proves the apple's gravity and the Moon's orbit are ONE inverse-square force. THE CANNONBALL: fire a ball horizontally from an impossibly high mountain. Too slow \u2192 it arcs to the ground. Faster \u2192 it lands farther, the Earth's surface curving away beneath it. Fast enough \u2192 the surface curves away exactly as fast as the ball falls, so it never gets closer to the ground: it FALLS AROUND the Earth forever. WHAT AN ORBIT IS: perpetual falling, done sideways fast enough to keep missing the ground \u2014 not a special celestial motion but ordinary falling plus sideways speed. The Moon does this; so does every satellite (Newton conceived the artificial satellite three centuries early); the related escape speed (~11.2 km/s from the surface) is the wall every rocket must beat. WHY ASTRONAUTS FLOAT: not because gravity is absent (it is nearly full strength at ISS altitude) but because astronaut and station are in CONSTANT FREE FALL together, falling around the Earth at the same rate \u2014 no relative acceleration, so they float; weightlessness IS perpetual falling. WHY THIS DISSOLVED THE ANCIENT DIVISION: for two thousand years the terrestrial realm (falling, corruption, straight lines) and the celestial realm (perfect eternal circles) were separate physics. The apple-and-Moon match shows the SAME force with the SAME law governs both; the Moon is simply a falling body like the apple. One checkable calculation collapses the two realms into ONE PHYSICS \u2014 the unification of heaven and Earth."}, {"id": "q7", "type": "open", "prompt": "Trace the full arc of the Great Revolution across its five chapters \u2014 the ancient cosmos, Copernicus, Kepler, Galileo, Newton \u2014 stating what each contributed and what each lacked. Then explain the honest limits of Newton's triumph (hypotheses non fingo; Mercury; Einstein), and the founding vision of physics that the completed revolution established.", "rubric": "THE ARC (each figure's contribution and lack): (1) THE ANCIENT COSMOS (Babylon/Greece/Ptolemy): a successful, reasonable, evidence-based Earth-centered model \u2014 predicted the sky for fourteen centuries \u2014 but built on geometric devices (epicycles, equant) that described without explaining, with unexplained coincidences tying every planet to the Sun. (2) COPERNICUS: the bold IDEA \u2014 Sun at the center, moving Earth \u2014 which dissolved the coincidences and yielded a scale model; but he kept the circle dogma, still needed epicycles, and offered no physics and no proof. (3) KEPLER: the exact LAWS \u2014 ellipses with the Sun at a focus, equal areas, T\u00b2 = a\u00b3 \u2014 wrung from Tycho's data (trusting eight arcminutes over two millennia of authority), eliminating the epicycles; but laws WITHOUT CAUSE \u2014 he never knew why they held. (4) GALILEO: the decisive EVIDENCE (telescope: Moon's mountains, Jupiter's moons, phases of Venus killing pure geocentrism) and the NEW PHYSICS OF MOTION (inertia, relativity of motion) answering the ancient objections; but no unifying force, and the case still incomplete (Tychonic alternative, no parallax). (5) NEWTON: the CAUSE \u2014 universal gravitation (F = Gm\u2081m\u2082/r\u00b2) plus the three laws of motion, from which all three Kepler laws FOLLOW (ellipse/focus from inverse-square, equal areas from central force, harmonic law from the inverse-square exponent), verified by the apple-and-Moon match, extended to weighing the Sun (M in T\u00b2 = 4\u03c0\u00b2a\u00b3/GM), tides, precession, comets, and the prediction of Neptune. Each supplied what the last lacked: idea \u2192 data \u2192 law \u2192 evidence/mechanics \u2192 cause. THE HONEST LIMITS: Newton gave the exact LAW of gravity but not its ultimate NATURE \u2014 'action at a distance' across empty space troubled him, and he refused to speculate: HYPOTHESES NON FINGO ('I frame no hypotheses'). Like Kepler, he gave law without ultimate cause \u2014 the pattern of science: each deeper law explains the last mystery and poses a new one. And one tiny crack \u2014 the anomalous precession of MERCURY's perihelion, reminiscent of Kepler's eight arcminutes \u2014 resisted Newtonian explanation until EINSTEIN's General Relativity (1915) recast gravity as the curvature of spacetime, explaining Mercury exactly and predicting light-bending (1919). Newton's gravity is not wrong: it is a superbly accurate approximation, still used for spacecraft, emerging from Einstein's theory in the weak-field limit \u2014 a monumental rung on a ladder that keeps climbing. THE FOUNDING VISION: the deepest legacy is the unified, COMPREHENSIBLE universe \u2014 beneath endless variety lie a few UNIVERSAL laws, discoverable by the human mind, holding everywhere the same, so studying nature HERE reveals the laws that govern EVERYWHERE. This is the template of every later unification (electromagnetism, spacetime, particle forces) and the foundation of the scientific worldview: the cosmos is one lawful system, and it is knowable. A strong answer names this as the completion of the two-thousand-year journey from the ancient sky to modern science."}]$astroNW_quiz$::jsonb as questions
)
